# Copy this file to .dev.vars (repo root) for local development and pick your own
# password of at least 15 characters; the deployment stores only a salted verifier.
# The model API key belongs in the workspace's Settings after sign-in, not in this file.
#
# Keep the value below EMPTY. The Deploy-to-Cloudflare form pre-fills its field with
# whatever sits after the equals sign; a non-empty example would ship every button
# deployment with a login password that is public knowledge in this repository.
LOGIN_PASSWORD=
